<p>(e) How many solutions does the system have?  If infinitely many, enter "Infinity".</p>
<p><fillin characters="25" name="AnSwEr0025"/></p>
<p>(f) What are the solutions to the system?</p>
<p>If there are no solutions, write "No Solution" or "None" for each answer.  If there are infinitely many solutions let <m>y = t</m> and solve for <m>x</m> in terms of <m>t</m>.</p>
<p><m>x=</m> <fillin characters="25" name="AnSwEr0026"/></p>
<p><m>y=</m> <fillin characters="25" name="AnSwEr0027"/></p>
